msgid "Each has a <0>plaza</0> at its centre. A plaza is a real intersection and the only place cargo changes hands, and <1>nothing may ever be built on one</1>. Four <2>spokes</2> run from the plaza out to the hex's four land intersections. A wagon drives a spoke for 2 movement and no toll, and no road can be built on one."
msgstr "Each has a <0>plaza</0> at its centre. A plaza is a real intersection and the only place cargo changes hands, and <1>nothing may ever be built on one</1>. Four <2>spokes</2> run from the plaza out to the hex's four land intersections. A wagon drives a spoke for 2 movement and no toll, and no road can be built on one."

