msgid "Every other player may accept, decline, or <0>counter</0> with terms of their own. An answer is <1>not final</1>: while the offer stands you can change it, replace a counter with different terms, or take it back entirely, as often as you like. Only sending the same answer twice is refused."
msgstr "Every other player may accept, decline, or <0>counter</0> with terms of their own. An answer is <1>not final</1>: while the offer stands you can change it, replace a counter with different terms, or take it back entirely, as often as you like. Only sending the same answer twice is refused."

