msgstr "Knights go to sea with you. A knight moves along your <0>roads and your ships</0>, and may finish its move on an empty intersection out in open water. The two networks are one route only where they meet at <1>a settlement or city of yours</1>, so a knight boards and lands at your own buildings. A knight may also be raised at the end of one of your ships, though never on a sea intersection."

