msgstr "Knights is the deepest mode. The victory target rises to <0>13</0>. There are <1>no development cards and no Largest Army</1>; their roles pass to <2>progress cards</2> and <3>knight pieces</3>. Cities now produce <4>commodities</4>, an event die drives <5>barbarian raids</5>, and three improvement tracks unlock powerful abilities."

